error[E0277]: `MyList` cannot implement a sealed Verum trait
  --> tests/ui/compile_fail/has_cannot_be_forged.rs:11:42
   |
11 | impl verum::Has<MyElem, verum::Here> for MyList {}
   |                                          ^^^^^^ not sealed by Verum
